description	"General Crix Madine

A speedy commander with a staggering Pistol, multiple Grenades, and gadgets.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Madine's DL-18 Blaster Pistol (3)
-- Staggers on hit
-- 35% more Dmg/FP Dmg
-- 25% slower RoF
-- 30% slower Mag Rld
- Frag Grenades (2)
- Electro-Flare Grenades (2) (Pulses)
-- Burns/pushes on det
- Cryo Grenades (2)
-- Tracks on det

^5Powers:
- Team Energize (1)

^6Inventory:
- Assault Sentry
- Forcefield
- Medpac ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- 10% more Kb Given
- Healing (2)
- Rally 

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS3]"